om2
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
fn argseg q edit ulong 16 y edit ulong * to ulong
i = mul get q 10 4
if gt add i 4 len y
ret 1
end
n = sub get q 1 get q 0
put y i get q 8
put y add i 1 get q 9
put y add i 2 or get q 0 shl n 32
put y add i 3 0
p = div add n sub get q 2 1 get q 2
if gt p get q 5
put q 5 p
end
w = mul get q 3 get q 4
put q 6 add get q 6 mul p w
put q 7 add get q 7 w
put q 0 get q 1
put q 10 add get q 10 1
ret 0
end
